      "title": "Oswal Pumps Limited (NSEI:OSWALPUMPS) acquired 8% stake in Walso Solar Solution Private Limited for INR 36.6 million.",
      "body": "Oswal Pumps Limited (NSEI:OSWALPUMPS) acquired 8% stake in Walso Solar Solution Private Limited for INR 36.6 million on June 8, 2026. A cash consideration of INR 36.6 million will be paid by Oswal Pumps Limited. Oswal Pumps Limited has acquired 4.5% stake on April 08, 2026 and has today acquired 8% stake and consequently, Walso Solar Solution Private Limited has now become subsidiary of Oswal Pumps Limited.\n\nFor the period ending March 31, 2026, Walso Solar Solution Private Limited reported total revenue of INR 1.7 billion.\n\nOswal Pumps Limited (NSEI:OSWALPUMPS) completed the acquisition of 8% stake in Walso Solar Solution Private Limited on June 8, 2026.",
